<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Mana Boost</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 100)
Mana: 100
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast mana boost &lt;person&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster focuses on another and broadcasts their own power to them, 
filling them with essence: the target gets back mana, about three 
quarters of what the spell costs you with a good casting, more with a 
better one, up to 100. It is a way for a sorcerer to share their mana 
with a friend who needs it more: a healer in a long fight, say.
</p><p>It works on people and other mammals. Cast on yourself, the essence only 
circles your body and returns to you: you get back the 100 mana you 
spent, and no more. A potion or scroll of mana boost, though, does give 
its drinker or reader fresh mana.
</p><p>You can cast it while resting or fighting, and no free hands are needed.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
